                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4d29500-e003-416d-824f-4eba49c4dc70",
                                "sense_id": "0c39a0c6-eda5-314d-bb86-afb0c66169c4",
                                "text": "— Поко́рно благодарю́, — ла́сково отозва́лся Обло́мов, принима́я пиро́г, и, загляну́в в дверь, упёрся взгля́дом в высо́кую грудь и го́лые пле́чи. Дверь торопли́во затвори́лась.",
                                "translation": "“I thank you kindly,” responded Oblomov graciously as he took the pie and, glancing at the door, locked his gaze on her high bosom and bare shoulders. The door shut hastily.",
                                "english": "“I thank you kindly,” responded Oblomov graciously as he took the pie and, glancing at the door, locked his gaze on her high bosom and bare shoulders. The door shut hastily."
